The '''Abbey Gardens''' are the grounds of the [[Saint Mara Abbey]], which was burned down under mysterious circumstances.<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|29+|Remember the Dead}}</ref> The undead still roam the gardens and abbey. A [[Crypt (Northwind)|crypt]] can be found in the abbey's graveyard.

